      "head": "{\"kind\":\"artifact\",\"artifact\":{\"title\":\"SGD on a Loss Bowl: Learning Rate and Batch Size\",\"description\":\"A shallow oval bowl surface with contour lines. Its height is the loss for two model settings, x running left to right (steep) and z running front to back (gentle). A red ball is the current guess. A purple arrow shows the next mini-batch step and a dark arrow shows the full-data step. An orange trail marks every step of the run, and a faded blue ghost shows the kept earlier run. Readouts show the step number, the loss, the length of the step and the run status.\",\"experience\":\"experiment\",\"behavior\":\"rules\",\"controlProfile\":\"inspect\",\"stepped\":true,\"scene\":{\"materials\":[{\"id\":\"bowlM\",\"color\":\"#8fa8c6\"},{\"id\":\"ballM\",\"color\":\"#d23c2a\"},{\"id\":\"trailM\",\"color\":\"#e8731a\"},{\"id\":\"ghostM\",\"color\":\"#1f3a7a\"},{\"id\":\"stepM\",\"color\":\"#7b2fbf\"},{\"id\":\"fullM\",\"color\":\"#2f3640\"}],\"geometries\":[{\"id\":\"bowlG\",\"kind\":\"surface\",\"width\":4,\"depth\":4,\"contours\":8,\"heights\":[[2.32,1.99,1.68,1.41,1.17,0.96,0.78,0.63,0.51,0.41,0.35,0.32,0.32,0.35,0.41,0.51,0.63,0.78,0.96,1.17,1.41,1.68,1.99,2.32],[2.27,1.93,1.63,1.36,1.12,0.91,0.72,0.57,0.45,0.36,0.3,0.27,0.27,0.3,0.36,0.45,0.57,0.72,0.91,1.12,1.36,1.63,1.93,2.27],[2.22,1.89,1.58,1.31,1.07,0.86,0.68,0.52,0.4,0.31,0.25,0.22,0.22,0.25,0.31,0.4,0.52,0.68,0.86,1.07,1.31,1.58,1.89,2.22],[2.17,1.84,1.54,1.27,1.03,0.81,0.63,0.48,0.36,0.27,0.21,0.18,0.18,0.21,0.27,0.36,0.48,0.63,0.81,1.03,1.27,1.54,1.84,2.17],[2.14,1.8,1.5,1.23,0.99,0.78,0.59,0.44,0.32,0.23,0.17,0.14,0.14,0.17,0.23,0.32,0.44,0.59,0.78,0.99,1.23,1.5,1.8,2.14],[2.1,1.77,1.47,1.19,0.95,0.74,0.56,0.41,0.29,0.2,0.14,0.11,0.11,0.14,0.2,0.29,0.41,0.56,0.74,0.95,1.19,1.47,1.77,2.1],[2.07,1.74,1.44,1.17,0.92,0.71,0.53,0.38,0.26,0.17,0.11,0.08,0.08,0.11,0.17,0.26,0.38,0.53,0.71,0.92,1.17,1.44,1.74,2.07],[2.05,1.72,1.41,1.14,0.9,0.69,0.51,0.36,0.23,0.14,0.08,0.05,0.05,0.08,0.1